<p>President Trump said he would try to force a journalist and media company to reveal the source behind reports that one member of a U.S. F-15E crew remained stranded in Iran after the aircraft was shot down last week, and said the reporter could face jail for refusing. He argued the disclosure made the rescue more dangerous by alerting Iranian forces that a second airman was still on the ground. White House officials later said both crew members were ultimately brought out alive. The episode has brought together two volatile issues: press freedom and national-security leaks, and the fallout from the downing of a U.S. F-15E over Iranian territory.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Dedicated rescue assets: Trump said 13 aircraft in the package were assigned specifically to rescue duties, showing that personnel recovery was a central part of the mission design.</li><li>Airman survival: According to Trump and subsequent reporting, the weapons systems officer was badly injured, hid in mountainous terrain, treated his own wounds, and sent his coordinates before extraction.</li><li>Combat setback: Al-Monitor reported that the F-15 shootdown was the first loss of a crewed American warplane over Iran in more than five weeks of fighting, and that another U.S. aircraft was heavily damaged during the rescue effort.</li><li>Unnamed target: Politico reported that Trump did not identify the journalist or media company he said he would pressure to reveal the source.</li></ul><blockquote>We’re going to go to the media company that released it and we’re going to say, ‘national security, give it up or go to jail,’ - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: Trump said the leak made the operation &quot;much more difficult&quot; and vowed to pressure the media organization involved to identify the source on national security grounds. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/04/06/trump-iran-pilot-rescue-media-threat-00860508'>Politico</a>)</li><li>White House national security officials: Officials framed the rescue as an example of coordinated U.S. military capability, using a White House briefing to release new operational details on how both airmen were recovered. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-news-conference-iran/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Reuters analysis: Reuters reported that the administration used the successful extraction to shift the political narrative away from the embarrassment of a downed U.S. jet and toward a story of resolve and competence in the Iran war. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/analysis-trump-seizes-rescue-downed-airman-recast-unpopular-iran-war'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Military reporting in BBC coverage: The BBC&#x27;s reconstruction emphasized how difficult it is to recover personnel from hostile, remote terrain and noted that the rescue involved multiple U.S. agencies rather than a simple pickup mission. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx2vpz1kwreo'>BBC</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/6/video-trump-threatens-to-jail-reporter-over-iran-airman-rescue-leak'>Video: Trump threatens to jail reporter over Iran airman rescue leak</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/637512-trump-jail-iran-raid-journalist/'>Trump threatens to jail journalist over Iran rescue raid ‘leak’</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/trump-threatens-jail-reporter-who-revealed-iran-airman-rescue'>Trump threatens jail for reporter who revealed Iran airman rescue</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-threatens-jail-for-reporter-who-revealed-iran-airman-rescue'>Trump threatens jail for reporter who revealed that only 1 airman had been rescued after jet crash</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/04/06/trump-iran-pilot-rescue-media-threat-00860508'>Trump threatens to jail journalist who reported on crew’s rescue in Iran if they don’t reveal source</a> - politico.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-news-conference-iran/'>Trump, top officials share new details of rescue of U.S. airmen from Iran</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx2vpz1kwreo'>How rescue of US airman in remote part of Iran unfolded</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/04/06/nx-s1-5775736/trump-provides-details-behind-the-dramatic-rescue-of-an-american-airman-trapped-in-iran'>Trump provides details behind the dramatic rescue of an American airman trapped in Iran</a> - npr.org</li></ul>